e_title", "score": 0.4218718707561493, "coordinate": [573, 716, 610, 739], "order": null, "polygon_points": [[573.0, 716.0], [609.0, 716.0], [609.0, 738.0], [573.0, 738.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.4971085786819458, "coordinate": [207, 900, 631, 947], "order": 7, "polygon_points": [[207.0, 900.0], [631.0, 900.0], [631.0, 947.0], [207.0, 947.0]]}, {"cls_id": 14, "label": "image", "score": 0.9199023842811584, "coordinate": [269, 1151, 1038, 1353], "order": null, "polygon_points": [[269.0, 1151.0], [1038.0, 1151.0], [1038.0, 1353.0], [269.0, 1353.0]]}]}}, "markdown": {"text": "## 考评奖励标准——休假\n\n五级【4~5分】：休闲成为生命常态。\n\n- 本条释义：不只特定的休假时光、而是生命的常态化时光都是轻松休闲的，工作和生活都是因为发自内心的喜欢和主动创造，乐在其中。它们都是休闲的一部分，也是生命的常态。\n\n符合的行为：\n\n1、自由、随性，选择或培养自己喜欢的、拒绝自己不喜欢的\n\n2、工作也是休闲，沉浸并享受于自己喜欢的事业\n\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\">[92]</div>\n\n\n考评奖励标准——健康\n\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"imgs/img_in_image_box_269_1151_1038_1353.jpg\" alt=\"Image\" width=\"64%\" /></div>\n", "images": {"imgs/img_in_image_box_269_1151_1038_1353.jpg": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//e47d32f3-50c5-4f12-b2eb-ef7a1afae762/markdown_0/imgs/img_in_image_box_269_1151_1038_1353.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T08%3A17%3A49Z%2F-1%2F%2F59b440c8fc51b517038eaa97baa9b743a85f3f1aeebed6d71b7a0ad91868225c"}}, "outputImages": {"layout_det_res": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//e47d32f3-50c5-4f12-b2eb-ef7a1afae762/layout_det_res_0.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T08%3A17%3A49Z%2F-1%2F%2F58bc30658536647c36816ef84afabd3cbfb4eb8e3a472ecbc1f138968c47ce07"}, "inputImage": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//e47d32f3-50c5-4f12-b2eb-ef7a1afae762/input_img_0.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T08%3A17%3A49Z%2F-1%2F%2Ffff5c6420ff76f29ab02d7b8b042d